  "goodToKnow": "Das Halbjahr is half a year: im ersten Halbjahr 2025. Companies report Halbjahreszahlen (half-year figures). The German school year is divided into two Halbjahre, not three terms; the Halbjahreszeugnis (mid-year report) comes out around late January, often followed by a few days off, the Winterferien in some states. Halbjährlich means every six months. Plural: die Halbjahre."
